cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Pecten in your work, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "Pecten: deterministic, multi-modal camera monitoring of birds"
abstract: >-
  An open platform for monitoring birds with visible-light, thermal, stereo-thermal and
  drone cameras. Edge software turns frames into tracks, counts and flight measurements with
  deterministic, explainable image processing, verified against a physics-based sensor twin, and
  a data platform turns those events into standards-based datasets.
authors:
